From: Duotek
Subject: [PATCH 0002] legacy and OpenDocument add-ons: relative import of the companion runtime

@silurus/ooxml-legacy-office 0.90.1 (dist/legacy-source-DmlTJjiH.js) and @silurus/ooxml-opendocument 0.90.1
(dist/odf-source-Cee46vyi.js) import the companion runtime by the bare specifier "@silurus/ooxml/internal/companion".
A page without an import map cannot resolve it, and the viewer CSP (script-src without 'unsafe-inline') forbids an
inline import map. Point both at the copy of the stock file internal-companion.mjs (from @silurus/ooxml 0.90.1 dist)
that sits next to them in static/lib/silurus/. The patch changes one string in each file.
Apply from static/lib/silurus/ with: patch -p1 < 0002-...patch   (paths below are a/ b/ relative)

---
--- a/legacy-source-DmlTJjiH.js
+++ b/legacy-source-DmlTJjiH.js
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-import { MODEL_SOURCE_MODULE_PROTOCOL as e, assertCompanionRuntime as t } from "@silurus/ooxml/internal/companion";
+import { MODEL_SOURCE_MODULE_PROTOCOL as e, assertCompanionRuntime as t } from "./internal-companion.mjs";
 //#region ../core/src/internal/bundled-asset-url.ts
 function n() {
 	let e = globalThis, t = e.document?.baseURI ?? e.location?.href;
--- a/odf-source-Cee46vyi.js
+++ b/odf-source-Cee46vyi.js
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
